	"Author": "DarkKassanova",
	"Description": "This mod changes your chicken&#39;s colors&#33;\r<br />Brown/Orange, Brown/Red, and Brown/Tan are for Brown Chicken.xnb and BabyBrown Chicken.xnb\r<br />Dark Gray, Gray, and White are for White Chicken.xnb and BabyWhite Chicken.xnb\r<br />\r<br />If you have any color suggestions, feel free to leave a comment&#33;\r<br />\r<br />[b][u]To Install:[/u][/b]\r<br />[b]1.[/b] Backup your BabyBrown Chicken.xnb , BabyWhite Chicken.xnb , Brown Chicken.xnb and White Chicken.xnb files located at\u00A0Steam&#92;steamapps&#92;common&#92;Stardew Valley&#92;Content&#92;Animals\r<br />[b]2.[/b] Download whichever color you want (or all colors&#33;)\r<br />[b]3.[/b] Extract the .rar and put the new .xnb file where your old one was (at the location above)\r<br />[b]4.[/b] Start up Stardew Valley and see your cute little chicks&#33;\r<br />\r<br />[u]My other animal mods:[/u]\r<br />[url=http://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/195/?]Zombie Cows[/url]\r<br />[url=http://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/186/?]Alternate Dino Colors[/url]\r<br />[url=http://www.nexusmods.com/stardewvalley/mods/184/?]Alternate Sheep Colors[/url]",
